{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, צְבַע","hw":"צְבַע","html":"I. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">צְבַע</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. dip, wet (</strong>𝔗 Syriac; cf. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, עָצַב\" href=\"/BDB,_עָצַב\", dir=\"rtl\">I. צבע</a>;—<strong>Pa.</strong> Pt. act. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצַבְּעִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:22\" href=\"/Daniel.4.22\">Dn 4:22</a> <em>wet</em> thee <span dir=\"rtl\">(ל)</span>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">מִטַּל</span>. <strong>Hithpa.</strong> Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִצְטַבַּע</span> (also -<span dir=\"rtl\">בַּ֑ע</span>); <em>be wet</em>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּטַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:12\" href=\"/Daniel.4.12\">4:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:20\" href=\"/Daniel.4.20\">20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִטַּל</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:30\" href=\"/Daniel.4.30\">30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:21\" href=\"/Daniel.5.21\">5:21</a>.<strong>)</strong>","next":"BDB Aramaic, צבע","prev":"BDB Aramaic, צְבוּ"}